      "content": "thanks for the breakdown. that makes me feel a lot better hearing that the risk is negligible despite the palpitations. \n\nsince you mentioned it's pretty straightforward, i'm wondering about the frequency. if a single 30mg dose doesn't seem like much, would it be safe to take one every 4 hours if the congestion is really bad? i have a huge deadline tomorrow and i just need to stay functional. i'd rather just manage it myself tonight than try to call my doctor during office hours.",
