      "content": "thanks, i really appreciate the reassurance. i'll try that dosing schedule tonight.\n\none more thing though—actually, as i was sitting here typing this, i felt my heart start racing pretty fast, like it's thumping against my ribs, and i've got this weird dizzy, lightheaded feeling. i'm starting to get a little spooked. i know you said the risk was negligible, but could these palpitations be a sign that the haloperidol is already affecting my heart, and adding the sudafed every 4 hours might make it worse? should i be looking for signs of a more serious heart issue like an arrhythmia?",
